          "type": "html",
          "name": "intro",
          "html": "<h1>Teaching {module} Self-paced Online Professional Learning</h1><h3><strong>Post-Module Survey</strong></h3>\n\n<p>Code.org relies on surveys as a crucial tool to stay connected to teachers, gather feedback about our curriculum and your teaching experience, and to improve our programs.</p>\n<p><strong>Privacy and Confidentiality</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Your individual responses here are completely confidential.</li>\n<li>Your identity will never be revealed publicly or used to tie any responses back to you personally.</li>\n<li>We may share anonymous, aggregate data (representing all responses) publicly.</li>\n<li>Your anonymized responses will be used by Code.org for program improvement.</li></ul>\n\n<p><strong>Your honesty and candor are appreciated.</strong></p><hr><h2>Teaching {module}: Post-Module Survey</h2>"
        },
